2
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:48,300
高鳴る心臓に祈りを乗せて
Sending a prayer through my throbbing heart,

3
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:51,200
曖昧な夢を描く
I paint an ambiguous dream.

4
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:54,100
幻想は想像のまま
Even if the fantasy remains a mere imagination,

5
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:57,500
終われないんだ
it cannot end here!

6
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:04,200
みんな！今日見に来てくれてありがとう！
Everyone! Thank you so much for coming to see me today!

7
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,100
答えを延々と探し続けて
Endlessly searching for the answer,

8
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:12,100
何者かになりたくて
wanting to become someone.

9
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:14,600
潸々と降る夕立を
The evening shower pouring heavily...

10
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:17,300
ただ眺めた
I just stared at it.

11
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:20,500
優しく寄り添って
Gently staying close,

12
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:23,200
心が晴れるのなら
if it could clear my heart,

13
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:27,000
翼が生えたような気がして
I feel as if I've grown wings,

14
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,000
いつだって隣にいるから
because I will always be by your side.

15
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:35,300
だって言葉紡いで唄うことが
For weaving words to sing

16
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:38,200
わたしの運命だ
is my destiny.

17
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:41,200
世界にありふれた虚しささえも
Overwriting even the emptiness

18
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,900
上書きして
common in this world,

19
00:03:43,900 --> 00:03:46,800
路地裏に咲いた花のように
like a flower blooming in a back alley,

20
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,400
願いを照らす
illuminating my wish.

21
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:55,500
小さな光に憧れて
Yearning for a small light...

22
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:09,600
名前を持たない歌なんて
A song without a name,

23
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:12,700
神様は認めてくれない
God will never acknowledge it.

24
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:18,000
一つ一つ枯れない花のように
Like flowers, one by one, that never wither.

25
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,200
昨日の自分にさよなりして
Saying goodbye to my yesterday self,

26
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,700
こぼれた涙
as my tears overflow.

27
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:29,500
うまく笑えなくてもいいかな
Is it okay if I can't smile well?

28
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:32,400
だって理想は遠ざかっていくばかり
Because ideals keep getting further away,

29
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:34,600
もう散々だよ
I'm so sick of it.

30
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:37,800
どれだけ手を伸ばして叫んだって
No matter how much I reach out and scream,

31
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,400
届かないの
it doesn't reach.

32
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:43,400
望めばいつか叶うはずって
Believing that if I wish for it,

33
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:46,000
信じている
it will come true someday.

34
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:51,600
どうか歌よ響いて
Please, oh song, resound!

35
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:57,600
あぁ心臓の鼓動が今日も
Ah, the beating of my heart today, too,

36
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,000
うるさい
