渋滞曖昧どっちを向いちゃうの 蜃気楼に手を伸ばした
Traffic jam, ambiguity, which way are you looking? I reached out my hand to a mirage.

47
00:06:26,588 --> 00:06:34,288
微熱のような夢物語 そんな光は見ない振りしていた
A dream-like story resembling a slight fever, I was pretending not to see such a light.

48
00:06:34,888 --> 00:06:37,888
ざわめく鼓動まだ行かないで
Throbbing heartbeat, don't go yet.

49
00:06:37,888 --> 00:06:41,288
幻じゃ嫌だよ 私を奪って
I don't want it to be an illusion, steal me away.

50
00:06:41,288 --> 00:06:45,188
魅惑の斬新な支配
Fascinating, novel control...

51
00:06:45,188 --> 00:06:48,188
広がって収まんない universe
...expanding into an uncontrollable universe.

52
