手探りでいいから
groping in the dark is fine.

153
00:14:28,529 --> 00:14:30,629
生まれたままの衝動
Hide the impulse just as you were born,

154
00:14:30,629 --> 00:14:33,929
隠して明星ギャラクティカ
morning star galactica.

155
