nothing to do with you

758
00:48:35,725 --> 00:48:38,725
ちょけろ ちょけろ
Stop messing around, stop messing around

759
00:48:38,725 --> 00:48:42,225
さぁ図に乗って いい加減にしろ
Now stop getting cocky, that's enough

760
00:48:42,225 --> 00:48:45,225
やめらんないねぇ はぜろ はぜろ
I can't stop, burst, burst

761
