現実味ねぇよ
There's no reality to it

769
00:49:11,725 --> 00:49:14,725
早く楽になりたい？
Do you want to be put out of your misery quickly?

770
00:49:14,725 --> 00:49:16,725
いつでもいいよ おねんねさせたれ
Anytime is fine, let's put them to sleep

771
00:49:16,725 --> 00:49:18,725
nothing to do with you

772
