779
00:49:46,725 --> 00:49:47,725
ねぇ are you kidding?
Hey, are you kidding?

780
00:49:47,725 --> 00:49:49,225
はい、ちょ、まって
Yes, wait, hold on

781
00:49:49,225 --> 00:49:50,225
ここでストップ
